return ['x-generator'=>'GlotPress/4.0.1','translation-revision-date'=>'2022-07-17 10:47:48+0000','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=n != 1;','project-id-version'=>'Plugins - Password Protected – Password Protect your WordPress Site, Pages, &amp; WooCommerce Products &#8211; Restrict Content, Protect WooCommerce Category, and more - Stable (latest release)','language'=>'en_GB','messages'=>['Having issue with Caching?'=>'Having an issue with caching?','Can be changed using the `password_protected_cookie_name` filter.'=>'Can be changed using the \'password_protected_cookie_name\' filter.','Cookie Name'=>'Cookie Name','Password Protected Plugin'=>'Password Protected Plugin','privacy policy contentThe Password Protected plugin stores a cookie on successful password login containing a hashed version of the entered password. It does not store any information about the user. The cookie stored is named <code>bid_n_password_protected_auth</code> where <code>n</code> is the blog ID in a multisite network'=>'The Password Protected plugin stores a cookie on successful password login containing a hashed version of the entered password. It does not store any information about the user. The cookie stored is named <code>bid_n_password_protected_auth</code> where <code>n</code> is the blog ID in a multisite network','Only authenticated users can access the REST API.'=>'Only authenticated users can access the REST API.','https://translate.wordpress.org/projects/wp-plugins/password-protected'=>'https://translate.wordpress.org/projects/wp-plugins/password-protected','Remember for this many days'=>'Remember for this many days','Allow Remember me'=>'Allow Remember me','Password Protection is disabled.'=>'Password Protection is disabled.','Password Protection is enabled.'=>'Password Protection is enabled.','In order for Password Protected to work with W3 Total Cache you must disable caching when the Password Protected cookie is set.'=>'In order for Password Protected to work with W3 Total Cache you must disable caching when the Password Protected cookie is set.','In order for Password Protected to work with WP Engine\'s caching configuration you must ask them to disable caching for the Password Protected cookie.'=>'In order for Password Protected to work with WP Engine\'s caching configuration you must ask them to disable caching for the Password Protected cookie.','It looks like you may be using the W3 Total Cache plugin?'=>'It looks like you may be using the W3 Total Cache plugin?','Password Protected does not always work well with sites that use caching.'=>'Password Protected does not always work well with sites that use caching.','W3 Total Cache'=>'W3 Total Cache','We have detected your site may be running on WP Engine hosting.'=>'We have detected your site may be running on WP Engine hosting.','WP Engine Hosting'=>'WP Engine Hosting','You can adjust the cookie settings for W3 Total Cache under <a href="%s">Performance > Page Cache > Advanced > Rejected Cookies</a>.'=>'You can adjust the cookie settings for W3 Total Cache under <a href="%s">Performance > Page Cache > Advanced > Rejected Cookies</a>.','If your site uses a caching plugin or your web hosting uses server-side caching, you may need to configure your caching setup to disable caching for the Password Protected cookie:'=>'If your site uses a caching plugin or your web hosting uses server-side caching, you may need to configure your caching setup to disable caching for the Password Protected cookie:','<p><strong>Protected Permissions</strong><br />Allow access for logged in users and administrators without needing to enter a password. You will need to enable this option if you want administrators to be able to preview the site in the Theme Customizer. Also allow RSS Feeds to be accessed when the site is password protected.</p>'=>'<p><strong>Protected Permissions</strong><br />Allow access for logged in users and administrators without needing to enter a password. You will need to enable this option if you want administrators to be able to preview the site in the Theme Customiser. Also allow RSS Feeds to be accessed when the site is password protected.</p>','Save Changes'=>'Save Changes','Settings'=>'Settings','Enabled'=>'Enabled','Translate'=>'Translate','Logout'=>'Logout','GitHub'=>'GitHub','Password Protected'=>'Password Protected','Password Protected Settings'=>'Password Protected Settings','<p><strong>Password Protected Status</strong><br />Turn on/off password protection.</p>'=>'<p><strong>Password Protected Status</strong><br />Turn on/off password protection.</p>','<p><strong>Password Fields</strong><br />To set a new password, enter it into both fields. You cannot set an `empty` password. To disable password protection uncheck the Enabled checkbox.</p>'=>'<p><strong>Password Fields</strong><br />To set a new password, enter it into both fields. You cannot set an `empty` password. To disable password protection uncheck the Enabled checkbox.</p>','Password Protected Status'=>'Password Protected Status','New Password'=>'New Password','Allow IP Addresses'=>'Allow IP Addresses','New password not saved. When setting a new password please enter it in both fields.'=>'New password not saved. When setting a new password please enter it in both fields.','New password not saved. Password fields did not match.'=>'New password not saved. Password fields did not match.','Password protect your web site. Users will be asked to enter a password to view the site.'=>'Password protect your web site. Users will be asked to enter a password to view the site.','For more information about Password Protected settings, view the "Help" tab at the top of this page.'=>'For more information about Password Protected settings, view the "Help" tab at the top of this page.','New password saved.'=>'New password saved.','Protected Permissions'=>'Protected Permissions','Allow Administrators'=>'Allow Administrators','Allow Logged In Users'=>'Allow Logged In Users','Allow RSS Feeds'=>'Allow RSS Feeds','Type your new password again.'=>'Type your new password again.','http://github.com/benhuson/password-protected'=>'http://github.com/benhuson/password-protected','You have enabled password protection but not yet set a password. Please set one below.'=>'You have enabled password protection but not yet set a password. Please set one below.','You have enabled password protection and allowed administrators and logged in users - other users will still need to enter a password to view the site.'=>'You have enabled password protection and allowed administrators and logged in users - other users will still need to enter a password to view the site.','You have enabled password protection and allowed administrators - other users will still need to enter a password to view the site.'=>'You have enabled password protection and allowed administrators - other users will still need to enter a password to view the site.','You have enabled password protection and allowed logged in users - other users will still need to enter a password to view the site.'=>'You have enabled password protection and allowed logged in users - other users will still need to enter a password to view the site.','Feeds are not available for this site. Please visit the <a href="%s">website</a>.'=>'Feeds are not available for this site. Please visit the <a href="%s">website</a>.','Incorrect Password'=>'Incorrect Password','<strong>ERROR</strong>: Cookies are blocked or not supported by your browser. You must <a href=\'http://www.google.com/cookies.html\'>enable cookies</a> to use WordPress.'=>'<strong>ERROR</strong>: Cookies are blocked or not supported by your browser. You must <a href=\'http://www.google.com/cookies.html\'>enable cookies</a> to use WordPress.','Password'=>'Password','Remember Me'=>'Remember Me','Log In'=>'Log In','https://wordpress.org/plugins/password-protected/'=>'https://wordpress.org/plugins/password-protected/','Enter one IP address per line.'=>'Enter one IP address per line.','A very simple way to quickly password protect your WordPress site with a single password. Please note: This plugin does not restrict access to uploaded files and images and does not work with some caching setups.'=>'A very simple way to quickly password protect your WordPress site with a single password. Please note: This plugin does not restrict access to uploaded files and images and does not work with some caching setups.']];